The directory contains some simple ELAN examples in the context of 
Symbolic Constraint Solving.

Subdirectories:
===============

Dio/ : solving a diophantine equation (Fortenbacher's method)
       a_1 x_1 + ... + a_m x_m = b_1 y_1 + ... + b_n y_n
       (over positive integers) 

MatchingAC/ : ``Syntactic'' AC-matching

UnifPb/ : Syntactic Unification and Commutative Unification with a 
          conjunction operator satisfying AC-axioms

Unification/ : my own version of syntactic Unification with a 
               conjunction operator satisfying no axioms

============================================================================

For any problem/comment/bug, feel free to contact elan@loria.fr

